{"strongs": "H7728", "word": "שׁוֺבֵב", "translit": "sho.vev", "root": "שובב", "morph": "H:A", "pos": "adjective", "gloss": "backturning, apostate", "definition": "שׁוֺבֵב adjective backturning, apostate (perhaps for ׳ מְשׁוֺ , see I. שׁוֺבָב ); — as substantive, ׳ לְשׁו Mic 2:4 (but read probably שׁוֺבֵינוּ our captors ); feminine הַבַּת הַשּׁוֺבֵבָה Jer 31:22 (of Israel), Jer 49:4 (of Ammon).", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8507')\">BDB8507</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H7728')\">H7728</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8506')\">BDB8506</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8508')\">BDB8508</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>שׁוֺבֵב</bdbheb> <b>adjective</b> <highlightword>backturning, apostate</highlightword> (perhaps for <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מְשׁוֺ</bdbheb>, see I.  <bdbheb><reflink>שׁוֺבָב</reflink></bdbheb>); — as substantive, <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>לְשׁו</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Mic 2:4\" b=\"33\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(33,2,4)\">Mic 2:4</ref> (but read probably <bdbheb>שׁוֺבֵינוּ</bdbheb> <highlight>our captors</highlight>); feminine <bdbheb>הַבַּת הַשּׁוֺבֵבָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 31:22\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(24,31,22)\">Jer 31:22</ref> (of Israel), <ref ref=\"Jer 49:4\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"49\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"49\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(24,49,4)\">Jer 49:4</ref> (of Ammon). </p><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Mic 2:4", "book": "MIC", "chapter": 2, "verse": 4}, {"raw": "Jer 31:22", "book": "JER", "chapter": 31, "verse": 22}, {"raw": "Jer 49:4", "book": "JER", "chapter": 49, "verse": 4}], "flagged": {"hebrew": ["שׁוֺבֵב", "׳", "מְשׁוֺ", "שׁוֺבָב", "לְשׁו", "שׁוֺבֵינוּ", "הַבַּת הַשּׁוֺבֵבָה"], "aramaic": [], "greek": [], "translit": [], "abbreviations": []}, "covers": [], "bdbid": "BDB8507", "source": "BDB", "testament": "OT"}